# SQLite side-car files -- transient, but resetToMain()'s `git stash -u` was sweeping
# them (found in 11 abandoned stashes 2026-09-03). Losing a -journal/-wal mid-write can
# leave the .db needing recovery on next open.
*.db-journal
*.db-wal
*.db-shm
community-coverage.json
task-domains.json
deep-dive-coverage.json
import-coverage.json
